        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents D09-D5410 Quaker Collection Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Quaker Single Cylinder Deadbolt is a reliable and secure solution designed to perfectly fit standard door cut-outs. This deadbolt offers enhanced protection and peace of mind for your home or office. Inspired by the rich heritage of the Quaker movement, this deadbolt exudes a classic elegance that complements any architectural style. Crafted with meticulous attention to detail, it features the clean look and fine craftsmanship reminiscent of a bygone era. The warm, aged finishes pay homage to the historical significance of Quaker design, adding a touch of nostalgia to your door. While the exterior showcases the charm of yesteryears, the interior provides modern convenience with a smooth thumb turn for effortless locking and unlocking. Embrace the spirit of tradition and add a touch of historical grace to your home or office with the Quaker Single Cylinder Deadbolt.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Traditional Quaker Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
